OL,3,GNEWSASinfield bid to sell 7,777 pairs
OL,4,Aof socks for MND
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer rugby league star and fundraiser
OL,7,FKevin Sinfield is aiming to sell 7,777
OL,8,Fpairs of sports socks as part of his
OL,9,Ffundraising mission for motor neurone
OL,10,Fdisease (MND) charities.
OL,12,FThe Sock It To MND campaign has been
OL,13,Flaunched in support of his seventh and
OL,14,Ffinal challenge - dubbed 7 in 7: The
OL,15,FGrand Finale.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
