OL,3,GNEWSASinfield bid to sell 7,777 pairs
OL,4,Aof socks for MND
OL,5,
OL,6,FStarting on 27 September and finishing
OL,7,Fat the Super League Grand Final on 3
OL,8,FOctober, the feat will see him run an
OL,9,Fultra marathon every day for seven
OL,10,Fconsecutive days, visiting all 12
OL,11,FEnglish Super League grounds between
OL,12,FHull and Manchester.
OL,14,FSpeaking ahead of his challenge,
OL,15,FSinfield said: "If we all do a tiny
OL,16,Fbit, it goes a long, long way."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
